  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "2. How to ask about the location of an object, store, etc.\n\nThe expression kono chikaku ni means 'in this vicinity' or 'near here.' You can use it when you ask about the location of an object, store, etc., as in the following example:\n\nKono chikaku ni depaato ga arimasu ka?\nIs there a department store near here?"
    }
